<title>CHINA: CROSS-HARBOUR INTERIM NET UP 18.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>CROSS-HARBOUR INTERIM NET UP 18.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   79.0   vs 67.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    27.0   vs 27.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    152.00 vs 127.97</p>
<p>    Turnover		     409.48 vs 386.06</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cross-Harbour Tunnel Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Cross-Harbour Tunnel, 26.7 percent owned by Wharf (Holdings) Ltd, operates a road tunnel between Hong Kong Island and the Kowloon Peninsula.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
